1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:01,986
(Raj:)three...

2
00:00:01,988 --> 00:00:03,818
(Sheldon:)two...

3
00:00:03,823 --> 00:00:05,223
(Amy:)one.

4
00:00:09,628 --> 00:00:11,528
(Dave:)That's too bad.

5
00:00:11,531 --> 00:00:14,031
(Howard:)Maybe we did make the test
too difficult.

6
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:15,833
(Raj:)I don't think it matters.
Look, Sheldon,

7
00:00:15,835 --> 00:00:18,765
(Raj:)I believe when the time is right
for you to meet someone,

8
00:00:18,771 --> 00:00:20,101
(Raj:)it'll just happen.

9
00:00:20,106 --> 00:00:22,776
(Raj:)Okay? Not because of
a test or a Web site,

10
00:00:22,775 --> 00:00:24,975
(knocking)
but because...

11
00:00:24,977 --> 00:00:28,217
We are the dreamers of dreams!

12
00:00:33,952 --> 00:00:36,522
(Howard:)It's an actual girl,
and she's really pretty.

13
00:00:36,522 --> 00:00:38,352
Answer it!

14
00:00:38,357 --> 00:00:39,827
(Sheldon:)All right.

15
00:00:46,031 --> 00:00:47,361
(Sheldon:)Can I help you?

16
00:00:47,366 --> 00:00:50,636
Um, a-are you the physicist that
placed the ad on Craigslist?

17
00:00:50,636 --> 00:00:51,766
(Sheldon:)Yes.

18
00:00:51,771 --> 00:00:53,871
(Girl:)Hi. I'm Vanessa Bennett.

19
00:00:53,873 --> 00:00:55,743
(Girl:)Sorry it took a while
for me to get here.

20
00:00:55,741 --> 00:00:57,241
(Girl:)I was stuck in this
boring symposium

21
00:00:57,243 --> 00:00:59,843
(Girl:)on atomic spectroscopy
when I came across your ad,

22
00:00:59,846 --> 00:01:01,346
(Girl:)and it saved my night.

